# Commit message conventions:
#   luci-app-shunetwork: <subject>
#
# Examples:
#   luci-app-shunetwork: add login retry backoff
#   luci-app-shunetwork: fix reload loop on config commit
#   luci-app-shunetwork: restructure to luasrc/ + root/ layout
#
# Scope (optional, for cross-cutting changes):
#   core:    shunetwork_core.sh
#   luci:    LuCI controller/CBI/views/i18n
#   build:   Makefile, ipk-build.sh, CI
#
# Keep first line under 72 chars. Use present tense.
